; ============================================================================
; font8x8.inc — Complete 8x8 bitmap font for ASCII 0x00..0x7E (shared)
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  Layout: 8 bytes per glyph, one byte per scanline, bit 7 = leftmost pixel.
;  The table is indexed by the RAW ASCII code (entries 0x00..0x1F are blank
;  padding), so a renderer must do  FONT + ch*8  with NO 0x20 bias.
;
;  Usage:  %include "common/font8x8.inc"   then reference the label FONT.
; ============================================================================

